<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Emerging growth company <span id="xdx_901_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20260702__20260702_zvdafbYOKyEg"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2026-07-02" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000029" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></p>

